aith uh and he would be  offended by the fact um you could argue  that the prime minister was a little  economical with the truth about these  parties when he said there were no  parties and no rules and regulations  were broken well we know currently the  police are investigating 12.  okay and we've just got one minute left  i'm afraid um well you know you've been  there you've got the t-shirt your  thoughts  no i mean andrew's absolutely right gary  streeter really shocked me because he's  a thoroughly  sensible really it does things when he  really believes very strongly in them  he's you know he doesn't just send off a  letter without a lot of careful thought  and that is deeply deeply significant  but there's a hell of an operation being  launched by the great klingon boris  johnson and his cronies to keep him in  power i don't know how long he's going  to stay i think it's scandalous and i  think it's deeply regrettable that  conservative mps are saying so much in  private yet they haven't got the courage  to come out get rid of him get somebody  else and get up when we're doing the  work that should be done

